WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.870
- From this moment,

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:05.620
every Barbadian becomes
the living embodiment

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.970
of the new republic.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:11.850
Whether fair or foul winds come our way,

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.740
Vessel Republic Barbados has set sail

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.382
on her maiden voyage.

00:00:18.382 --> 00:00:20.965
(lively music)

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:36.850
- From the darkest days of our past

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.370
and the appalling atrocity of slavery,

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.673
which forever stains our history,

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.100
the people of this
island forged their path

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.736
with extraordinary fortitude.

00:00:49.736 --> 00:00:51.637
- [Observer] And the
first look, there she is.

00:00:51.637 --> 00:00:54.387
(crowd cheering)

00:01:04.505 --> 00:01:07.686
- May you continue to shine like a diamond

00:01:07.686 --> 00:01:10.046
and bring honor to your nation

00:01:10.046 --> 00:01:12.546
by your words, by your actions

00:01:14.186 --> 00:01:18.113
and to do credit wherever you shall go.

00:01:18.113 --> 00:01:21.200
- Faithful and be a true
allegiance to Barbados

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.363
according to law, so help me God.

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.860
We are Barbadians,

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:32.860
we the people must give
Republic Barbados its spirit

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.030
and its substance.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.602
We must shape its future.

00:01:37.602 --> 00:01:42.602
We are each other's and
our nation's keepers.

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:45.393
We, the people, are Barbados.

00:01:46.961 --> 00:01:49.794
(people clapping)

00:01:55.499 --> 00:01:58.082
(lively music)

